{"id":"cercano","lemma":"cercano","pos":"adj","rank":1904,"glosses":["near, nearby, close"],"ipa":"/θeɾˈkano/","forms":{"feminine":"cercana","masculinePlural":"cercanos","femininePlural":"cercanas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-cercano.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Dónde queda el hotel más cercano?","en":"Where's the nearest hotel?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594351"},{"text":"¿Dónde está la iglesia más cercana?","en":"Where's the nearest church?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589675"},{"text":"¿Cuántos amigos cercanos tienes?","en":"How many close friends do you have?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/606517"},{"text":"La policía acordonó las calles cercanas al hotel de forma inmediata mientras buscaban la bomba.","en":"Police immediately sealed off the streets around the hotel as they searched for the bomb."},{"text":"¿Dónde está el museo más cercano?","en":"Where's the nearest museum?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38253"}]}